{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Enter an awesome world, filled with unique monsters and unlimited crafting.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of <i>The RuneChild.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient kingdom full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers.!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an\u00a0<strong>Open-World, Fantasy Game;</strong>\u00a0emphasizing Freedom, Exploration, and Creative Crafting.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The World's Riches, Multi-layered Crafting Game.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Unlimited Character Classes,\u00a0Boundless Sword Crafting,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme Spell Combining and An Abundance in Potion Crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a WRPG (Western Role-Playing Game). </strong>Open world, unlimited crafting, Multi-Classes and construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/3e9c9b7111b75f65a541979d556abd9d.avif?t=1769926417\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlimited Character Customization</u></strong><u>:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 start classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Races /\u00a05 different heights for each race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15^5 different Attributes combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(One is a class Attribute, and has to be minimum 12.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 different Skills /\u00a0100 different Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+5 Billion Different Characters.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not counting cosmetics, like skin colour, hair and beard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting your own Sword and improve it with smiting and Enchantments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Boundless Sword Crafting:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 different Blades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Sword Sizes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 different Guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 different Pommels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Metals for the Guard/Pommel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 different Handles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Different Colours for the Handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Enchantments (None / Fire / Cold / Shock / Poison / Soul trap).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels of enchantments (+1, +2.....)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+6.8 Billion Different Swords.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Extreme Spell Combinations:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >59 different Main Types spells. (+ 18 sub-types.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 target (Yourself, touch, shield, target --&gt; Storm)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Strengths / 20 Duration /\u00a020 Range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+3 millions Spell Combinations</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Abundance Potion Crafting:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50^4 different ingredients. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can combine up to 4 ingredients, and up to 4 different effects in one potion.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different Strength/Duration. (Strong effect/No duration --&gt; Weak effect/Long duration.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Different table for making potions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+100 Million Different Potion Combinations.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Crafting;</strong>\u00a0with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cottage Building</strong>; Build your own cottage, anywhere on any map, and have a secure home Base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s 'Lord of the Rings' universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Visit WolfShire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8ab1d9b80b192bcbc4c9969296bbe16671b255d2.jpg"},{"name":"Visit MossField","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/6cbb0ffd749d6aba9584fe6fe0865ca84eaba61d.jpg"},{"name":"Casual: Row Your Boat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/92639f450cb82409d0c5a64cf9b4ae1bf4c0cb9d.jpg"},{"name":"Casual: Just 5 more Minutes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/3a7785567e03485d6876e6afaef86ef60900311e.jpg"},{"name":"Casual: Sitting Down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/8e4d14c74ee149305c88f94d26aed06e87fa780f.jpg"},{"name":"Animals: Riding a Mount ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/ebe620fe91c50b33e755e447bf278e6f18292d23.jpg"},{"name":"Killed a Golden Spider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7a5687da4fccbf7e85d8d3f76e063173d512bd94.jpg"},{"name":"Open First Page","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/5ce8ac95a57d96b9c86f823df22598a352477ec2.jpg"},{"name":"Start as Human","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/7b867e2a2f71a16b432213fd9ec67697da8e190a.jpg"},{"name":"Start as Hafling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1078610/9d7f8d101b15ef95000aab798cf78b003c7a8825.jpg"}],"total":70},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1078610?t=1769926417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/22cb09e7962c8834331a268725a2f12da082e34c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769926417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/8c9e7cf748682e4b0aa546a0cbb35a272151ceb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769926417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/8c9e7cf748682e4b0aa546a0cbb35a272151ceb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769926417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2614440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Enter an awesome world, filled with unique monsters and unlimited crafting.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of <i>The RuneChild.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient kingdom full of magic, adventure, and amazing powers.!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter an\u00a0<strong>Open-World, Fantasy Game;</strong>\u00a0emphasizing Freedom, Exploration, and Creative Crafting.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The World's Riches, Multi-layered Crafting Game.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring Unlimited Character Classes,\u00a0Boundless Sword Crafting,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extreme Spell Combining and An Abundance in Potion Crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a WRPG (Western Role-Playing Game). </strong>Open world, unlimited crafting, Multi-Classes and construction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/extras/3e9c9b7111b75f65a541979d556abd9d.avif?t=1769926417\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unlimited Character Customization</u></strong><u>:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 start classes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Races /\u00a05 different heights for each race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15^5 different Attributes combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(One is a class Attribute, and has to be minimum 12.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 different Skills /\u00a0100 different Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+5 Billion Different Characters.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not counting cosmetics, like skin colour, hair and beard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting your own Sword and improve it with smiting and Enchantments.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Boundless Sword Crafting:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 different metals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 different Blades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Sword Sizes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 different Guards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 different Pommels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Different Metals for the Guard/Pommel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 different Handles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Different Colours for the Handle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Enchantments (None / Fire / Cold / Shock / Poison / Soul trap).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels of enchantments (+1, +2.....)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+6.8 Billion Different Swords.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Extreme Spell Combinations:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >59 different Main Types spells. (+ 18 sub-types.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 target (Yourself, touch, shield, target --&gt; Storm)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Strengths / 20 Duration /\u00a020 Range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+3 millions Spell Combinations</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Abundance Potion Crafting:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50^4 different ingredients. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can combine up to 4 ingredients, and up to 4 different effects in one potion.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 different Strength/Duration. (Strong effect/No duration --&gt; Weak effect/Long duration.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Different table for making potions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>+100 Million Different Potion Combinations.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spell Crafting;</strong>\u00a0with over a million ways to combine spells\u2014from a simple fireball to a lightning storm that covers the whole map.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enchanting:</strong> Make your character Unique with his own enchantments on weapons, Armour and Jewellery. Buy them in the many shops, or make them yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cottage Building</strong>; Build your own cottage, anywhere on any map, and have a secure home Base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u>\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I love playing open-world RPGs like <i>Skyrim</i>, <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Morrowind</i>, as well as exploring Tolkien\u2019s 'Lord of the Rings' universe. So, I\u2019ve taken the parts I enjoy most from them: the wild magic and alchemy from <i>Morrowind</i>, the bright colors of <i>Oblivion</i>, and <i>Skyrim</i>\u2019s weapon improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So if you like skyrim, or if you like morrowind, then try this game.</p>","developers":["J. C. SpringBourne"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078610/fb33143582cf77f0ee54ea8f800bcda1e3c673c3/header.jpg?t=1769926417","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1078610/1822208773/cae08d8ba12e0de63ec0582b595d69657c1ec990/1769257122/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769257471","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1078610/1822208773/cae08d8ba12e0de63ec0582b595d69657c1ec990/1769257122/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769257471","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile